abel\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Pirate Ship, Dugg's Digging</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Fuse Time\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Fuse Time</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Blast Radius\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blast Radius</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">25</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Blast Pressure\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blast Pressure</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">800</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span style=\"color: green;\">$1200</span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.25.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">July 14th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Large Bomb</b> is an explosive that can be purchased from the <a href=\"/wiki/Pirate_Boat\" title=\"Pirate Boat\">Pirate Boat</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Dugg%27s_Digging\" title=\"Dugg&#39;s Digging\">Dugg's Digging</a> for <span style=\"color: green;\"><b>$1200</b></span> . It is a large version of the standard <a href=\"/wiki/Small_Bomb\" title=\"Small Bomb\">Small Bomb</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Large Bomb has an extremely powerful explosion, but a moderate radius. The Large Bomb's blast <b>can instantly open any destructible wall</b> in the game.\n</p><p>Unlike dynamite, bombs have a delayed chain reaction. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This item used to cost <span style=\"color: green;\">$16000</span>. Its price was reduced to <span style=\"color: green;\">$5000</span> in an earlier update. In <span class=\"new\" title=\"Update Log/Version 1.50.0 (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVXBkYXRlX0xvZy9WZXJzaW9uXzEuNTAuMD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Version 1.50.0</span>, the price was reduced to <span style=\"color: green;\">$1200</span>.</li>\n<li>This item is the cheapest way to destroy any destructible wall, the second place being the <a href=\"/wiki/Dynamite_Stick_x7\" title=\"Dynamite Stick x7\">Dynamite Stick x7</a>, but these can roll and dont destroy the wall, making you waste a bomb</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903155252\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreproc